    <description>Lightweight .NET fuzzy string matching library with intelligent scoring for search-as-you-type, command palettes, and flexible string matching applications.</description>
    <releaseNotes>## v1.2.38 (patch)

Changes since v1.2.37:

- ci: make the SonarQube quality gate opt in [patch] ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))
- ci: adopt the unified dotnet workflow [patch] ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))</releaseNotes>
